          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_method_comes_provable_non_asymptotic",
          "text": "The method comes with provable non-asymptotic convergence guarantees, and it exposes parameters that let the user trade off per-iteration cost against convergence speed.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "method",
            "comes",
            "provable",
